OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early light rain across the
OL,6,Fsouth will clear to leave a dry and
OL,7,Fbright morning across the region.
OL,8,FCloud will tend to increase throughout
OL,9,Fthe afternoon with a band of rain and
OL,10,Fstrengthening winds arriving from the
OL,11,Fnorthwest later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA wet evening, with the rain
OL,14,Fheavy and persistent for a time.
OL,15,FTurning drier overnight with some
OL,16,Fclear spells developing and winds also
OL,17,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
