OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA day of sunshine and
OL,6,Fshowers, with the showers turning
OL,7,Fheavy and thundery in places. Winds
OL,8,Falso freshening once again helping to
OL,9,Fgive a rather cool feel to the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDrier
OL,12,Fand brighter on Wednesday with spells
OL,13,Fof sunshine. Another band of rain then
OL,14,Fmoves in for Thursday, before drier
OL,15,Fand brighter weather returns on
OL,16,FFriday. Temperatures likely around
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
